<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<subsubsection xml:id="materials"><title>Materials and Resources</title>
<paragraphs xml:id="texts"><title>Primary Reference</title>
        <p>
                The main text for this course will be
                <pubtitle>Active Calculus</pubtitle> by Matthew Boelkins, ISBN13:978-1724458322. This is available as an interactive <url href='https://activecalculus.org/single/book-1.html' visual='ActiveCalculus.org/single/book-1.html'>on-line text</url> It is also available as a downloadable PDF or in hard copy as a paperback. For these options, go to the <url href='https://activecalculus.org/acs/' visual='activecalculus.org/acs/'>Active Calculus <ndash/> Single Variable</url>
        </p>
        <p>
                        We will also use the <url href='https://activecalculus.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/acs-activity-workbook-14-2024.pdf' visual='activecalculus.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/acs-activity-workbook-14-2024.pdf'>Active Calculus Student Workbook</url>
                        You can purchase the Student Workbook in the GVSU bookstore.
        </p>
</paragraphs>
<paragraphs xml:id="readings"><title>Additional Materials</title> 
<p> Any required supplementary material used will be put placed on BlackBoard, on reserve in
the library, or otherwise made available to you.
</p>
</paragraphs>
</subsubsection>
